Helpers:
- `decks()` returns `(vanilla_deck(DECK_SIZE, 1), vanilla_deck(DECK_SIZE, 21))`.
- `options(seed, marks)` calls `setup_catalog()` and returns `CreateGameOptions { seed, decks: decks(), deck_marks: marks, ..Default::default() }`.
